{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to build this script with xorq. According to the instructions, I should run:\n`xorq build .xorq/scripts/farmers_markets_per_capita.py --builds-dir .xorq/builds --emit-build-path-to /tmp/bp.txt`\n\nThen use:\n`xorq catalog -p .xorq/catalog add \"$(cat /tmp/bp.txt)\" -a <alias> --no-sync`","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me build and add this to the catalog:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01MZHUM7K3CGKXUEN8SqtEYv","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /private/tmp/trial-pi-18-r1u0831d && xorq build .xorq/scripts/farmers_markets_per_capita.py --builds-dir .xorq/builds --emit-build-path-to /tmp/bp.txt 2>&1 && cat /tmp/bp.txt"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":254,"cacheRead":14443,"cacheWrite":1222,"totalTokens":15931,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.00127,"cacheRead":0.0014443000000000001,"cacheWrite":0.0015275,"total":0.0042538},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":113},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786914536308,"responseId":"msg_011Ce77SRPGeRuEHtxUcs6PX","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01MZHUM7K3CGKXUEN8SqtEYv","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Building expr from .xorq/scripts/farmers_markets_per_capita.py\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/nix/store/yvlv6n4rx6dnnvhi7sgc5lm0152pa8mx-pi-xorq-duel-dev-env/lib/python3.13/site-packages/xorq/cli.py\", line 797, in invoke\n    return super().invoke(ctx)\n           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^\n  File \"/nix/store/yvlv6n4rx6dnnvhi7sgc5lm0152pa8mx-pi-xorq-duel-dev-env/lib/python3.13/site-packages/click/core.py\", line 1873, in invoke\n    return _process_result(sub_ctx.command.invoke(sub_ctx))\n                           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/nix/store/yvlv6n4rx6dnnvhi7sgc5lm0152pa8mx-pi-xorq-duel-dev-env/lib/python3.13/site-packages/click/core.py\", line 1269, in invoke\n    return ctx.invoke(self.callback, **ctx.params)\n           ~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/nix/store/yvlv6n4rx6dnnvhi7sgc5lm0152pa8mx-pi-xorq-duel-dev-env/lib/python3.13/site-packages/click/core.py\", line 824, in invoke\n    return callback(*args, **kwargs)\n  File \"/nix/store/yvlv6n4rx6dnnvhi7sgc5lm0152pa8mx-pi-xorq-duel-dev-env/lib/python3.13/site-packages/xorq/cli.py\", line 1149, in build\n    build_command(\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~^\n        script_path,\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^\n    ...<5 lines>...\n        emit_build_path_to=emit_build_path_to,\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n    )\n    ^\n  File \"/nix/store/yvlv6n4rx6dnnvhi7sgc5lm0152pa8mx-pi-xorq-duel-dev-env/lib/python3.13/site-packages/xorq/cli.py\", line 57, in wrapper\n    return fn(*args, **kwargs)\n  File \"/nix/store/yvlv6n4rx6dnnvhi7sgc5lm0152pa8mx-pi-xorq-duel-dev-env/lib/python3.13/site-packages/xorq/cli.py\", line 276, in build_command\n    vars_module = import_from_path(script_path, module_name=\"__main__\")\n  File \"/nix/store/yvlv6n4rx6dnnvhi7sgc5lm0152pa8mx-pi-xorq-duel-dev-env/lib/python3.13/site-packages/xorq/common/utils/import_utils.py\", line 77, in import_from_path\n    return import_python(path, module_name)\n  File \"/nix/store/yvlv6n4rx6dnnvhi7sgc5lm0152pa8mx-pi-xorq-duel-dev-env/lib/python3.13/site-packages/xorq/common/utils/import_utils.py\", line 13, in import_python\n    ).load_module()\n      ~~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap_external>\", line 677, in _check_name_wrapper\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap_external>\", line 1204, in load_module\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap_external>\", line 1028, in load_module\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap>\", line 534, in _load_module_shim\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap>\", line 866, in _exec\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap_external>\", line 1023, in exec_module\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap>\", line 4